UPDATE inform.politician_context SET reasoning = 'Lam, a child of immigrants, supports comprehensive immigration reform and a citizenship pathway for DREAMers. He sponsored the Maryland Data Privacy Act (SB0977 2025) restricting cooperation with federal immigration enforcement and previously expanded healthcare to undocumented immigrants.',
